{% comment %}
  Add-on products: sold only as a companion to Paraat Bhujia, never browsed on their own.

  Outputs the handles comma-wrapped on both sides, so `contains` cannot match a handle
  that merely starts with another one. Everything that gates them reads this one list:
  - layout/theme.liquid redirects their product pages to the anchor product and blocks
    clicks on any link pointing at them
  - product-upsell / cart-recommendation-card render them without a link
  - cart-recommendations only offers them while the anchor product is in the cart
  - search, predictive search, collection grids, featured collections and related
    products leave them out; the cart page shows them unlinked
  - they carry the product tag 'addon', which The Bhandaar's smart-collection rule
    excludes (TAG not equal to addon) -- tag any future add-on the same way

  The anchor product (where add-on pages redirect to, and what must be in the cart for
  the drawer to suggest them) is 'paraat-bhujia'.

  Usage:
  {%- capture addon_handles -%}{% render 'addon-products' %}{%- endcapture -%}
  {%- assign marker = ',' | append: product.handle | append: ',' -%}
  {%- if addon_handles contains marker -%}...{%- endif -%}
{% endcomment %}
,gathri,jhola,
